기존 코드의 극소형 폰트(`text-[9px]`~`text-[11px]`), 브라우저 흐름을 끊는 기본 `alert()` 팝업, 허위 기본값(`360`), 그리고 모든 탭 하단에 고정되어 화면 집중도를 떨어뜨리던 알림·SLA 콘솔 구조를 개선한 UI/UX 리팩토링 코드입니다. 별도의 외부 패키지 추가 설치 없이 기존에 설치된 `motion/react`와 `lucide-react`만으로 바로 적용할 수 있도록 구성했습니다.

---

### 주요 UI/UX 개선 포인트

* **비차단형 토스트(Toast) 알림 도입**: 스크래핑 완료 및 오류 발생 시 화면을 멈추던 네이티브 `alert()`을 제거하고, 우측 상단 슬라이드 토스트 배너로 교체했습니다.


* **우측 슬라이드 드로어(Drawer) 및 탭 분리**: 화면 하단에 항상 고정 노출되던 `AlertTracker`를 우측 슬라이드 드로어(맞춤 알림 설정·내역)와 **'SLA 품질 모니터' 전용 탭**으로 분리해 메인 분석 화면의 몰입도를 높였습니다.


* **타이포그래피 스케일 및 가독성 상향**: 판독이 어렵던 `text-[9px]`, `text-[10px]` 크기를 제거하고 최소 `text-xs`(12px)~`text-sm`(14px) 위계로 재설계했습니다.


* **데이터 투명성 배지 및 스켈레톤 적용**: 데이터가 없을 때 `360`을 출력하던 하드코딩을 로딩 스켈레톤으로 대체하고, 헤더에 `실시간 연동` / `시뮬레이션 모드` 상태 배지를 명확히 구분했습니다.



---

### 1. `src/App.tsx` (토스트 알림, 우측 알림 드로어, SLA 전용 탭 적용)

기존 `src/App.tsx`의 레이아웃과 인터랙션 핸들러를 아래 코드로 교체하세요.

```tsx
/**
 * @license
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 */
import React, { useState, useEffect, useCallback } from "react";
import { motion, AnimatePresence } from "motion/react";
import {
  Activity,
  Sparkles,
  Bell,
  FileSpreadsheet,
  Play,
  CheckCircle2,
  TrendingUp,
  LogOut,
  Clock,
  ShieldCheck,
  AlertTriangle,
  Flame,
  FileText,
  Database,
  X
} from "lucide-react";
import { User } from "firebase/auth";
import { Category, Product, ScrapeRun, CustomAlert, TriggeredAlert, MDInsight } from "./types";
import { initAuth, googleSignIn, googleSignOut } from "./firebase";
import RankingBoard from "./components/RankingBoard";
import ChartsBoard from "./components/ChartsBoard";
import AIAdvisor from "./components/AIAdvisor";
import SheetsExport from "./components/SheetsExport";
import AlertTracker from "./components/AlertTracker";
import ReportBuilder from "./components/ReportBuilder";

interface ToastMessage {
  id: number;
  type: "success" | "error";
  title: string;
  description: string;
}

export default function App() {
  // Navigation & Drawer States ("monitoring" 탭 추가)
  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState<"rankings" | "charts" | "ai" | "sheets" | "reports" | "monitoring">("rankings");
  const [isAlertDrawerOpen, setIsAlertDrawerOpen] = useState(false);
  const [toast, setToast] = useState<ToastMessage | null>(null);

  // Auth States
  const [user, setUser] = useState<User | null>(null);
  const [needsAuth, setNeedsAuth] = useState(true);
  const [token, setToken] = useState<string | null>(null);

  // Core Data
  const [categories, setCategories] = useState<Category[]>([]);
  const [historyRuns, setHistoryRuns] = useState<ScrapeRun[]>([]);
  const [selectedCategory, setSelectedCategory] = useState("all");
  const [selectedTimestamp, setSelectedTimestamp] = useState("");

  // Loaded rankings
  const [domesticProducts, setDomesticProducts] = useState<Product[]>([]);
  const [globalProducts, setGlobalProducts] = useState<Product[]>([]);
  const [historicalData, setHistoricalData] = useState<{ timestamp: string; products: Product[] }[]>([]);

  // Alerts & Logs
  const [alerts, setAlerts] = useState<CustomAlert[]>([]);
  const [triggeredAlerts, setTriggeredAlerts] = useState<TriggeredAlert[]>([]);
  const [monitoringLogs, setMonitoringLogs] = useState<any[]>([]);

  // Page Loaders
  const [isScraping, setIsScraping] = useState(false);
  const [isDataLoading, setIsDataLoading] = useState(false);
  const [hasNewAlert, setHasNewAlert] = useState(false);

  const showToast = useCallback((type: "success" | "error", title: string, description: string) => {
    const id = Date.now();
    setToast({ id, type, title, description });
    setTimeout(() => {
      setToast((prev) => (prev?.id === id ? null : prev));
    }, 4500);
  }, []);

  // 1. Initialize Auth State
  useEffect(() => {
    initAuth(
      (currentUser, accessToken) => {
        setUser(currentUser);
        setToken(accessToken);
        setNeedsAuth(false);
      },
      () => {
        setUser(null);
        setToken(null);
        setNeedsAuth(true);
      }
    );
  }, []);

  // 2. Fetch Initial Categories & Run History
  const fetchMetadata = async () => {
    try {
      const [catRes, runRes] = await Promise.all([
        fetch("/api/categories"),
        fetch("/api/scrape-history")
      ]);
      const catData = await catRes.json();
      setCategories(catData);

      const runData = await runRes.json();
      if (Array.isArray(runData)) {
        setHistoryRuns(runData);
        if (runData.length > 0 && !selectedTimestamp) {
          setSelectedTimestamp(runData[0].timestamp);
        }
      } else {
        setHistoryRuns([]);
      }
    } catch (err) {
      console.error("Error loading app metadata:", err);
      setHistoryRuns([]);
    }
  };

  const fetchAlerts = async () => {
    try {
      const [alertRes, trigRes] = await Promise.all([
        fetch("/api/alerts"),
        fetch("/api/triggered-alerts")
      ]);
      const alertData = await alertRes.json();
      setAlerts(Array.isArray(alertData) ? alertData : []);

      const trigData = await trigRes.json();
      setTriggeredAlerts(Array.isArray(trigData) ? trigData : []);
    } catch (err) {
      console.error("Error loading alert configurations:", err);
    }
  };

  const fetchMonitoringLogs = async () => {
    try {
      const res = await fetch("/api/monitoring-logs");
      const data = await res.json();
      if (Array.isArray(data)) setMonitoringLogs(data);
    } catch (err) {
      console.error("Error loading monitoring logs:", err);
    }
  };

  useEffect(() => {
    fetchMetadata();
    fetchAlerts();
    fetchMonitoringLogs();
  }, []);

  // Poll for triggered alerts periodically (every 12 seconds)
  useEffect(() => {
    const interval = setInterval(async () => {
      try {
        const trigRes = await fetch("/api/triggered-alerts");
        if (!trigRes.ok) return;
        const contentType = trigRes.headers.get("content-type");
        if (!contentType?.includes("application/json")) return;
        const trigData = await trigRes.json();

        if (Array.isArray(trigData)) {
          setTriggeredAlerts((prev) => {
            const currentUnread = prev.filter((t) => !t.isRead).length;
            const newUnread = trigData.filter((t: TriggeredAlert) => !t.isRead).length;
            if (newUnread > currentUnread) setHasNewAlert(true);
            return trigData;
          });
        }
      } catch (err) {
        console.warn("Polling request failed silently:", err);
      }
    }, 12000);
    return () => clearInterval(interval);
  }, []);

  // 3. Load Rankings Data in Parallel
  const loadRankings = useCallback(async () => {
    if (!selectedCategory || !selectedTimestamp) return;
    setIsDataLoading(true);
    try {
      const [domRes, globRes, histRes] = await Promise.all([
        fetch(`/api/rankings?category=${selectedCategory}&mallType=domestic&timestamp=${selectedTimestamp}`),
        fetch(`/api/rankings?category=${selectedCategory}&mallType=global&timestamp=${selectedTimestamp}`),
        fetch(`/api/rankings/history?category=${selectedCategory}&mallType=domestic&limitCount=6`)
      ]);

      const [domData, globData, histData] = await Promise.all([
        domRes.json(),
        globRes.json(),
        histRes.json()
      ]);

      setDomesticProducts(domData.products || []);
      setGlobalProducts(globData.products || []);
      setHistoricalData(Array.isArray(histData) ? histData : []);
    } catch (err) {
      console.error("Error loading rankings data:", err);
    } finally {
      setIsDataLoading(false);
    }
  }, [selectedCategory, selectedTimestamp]);

  useEffect(() => {
    loadRankings();
  }, [selectedCategory, selectedTimestamp, loadRankings]);

  // Interactive Actions
  const handleLogin = async () => {
    try {
      const res = await googleSignIn();
      if (res) {
        setUser(res.user);
        setToken(res.accessToken);
        setNeedsAuth(false);
        showToast("success", "Google 계정 연결 완료", "Google Sheets 내보내기 기능이 활성화되었습니다.");
      }
    } catch (err: any) {
      showToast("error", "로그인 실패", err.message || "Google 인증 중 오류가 발생했습니다.");
    }
  };

  const handleLogout = async () => {
    await googleSignOut();
    setUser(null);
    setToken(null);
    setNeedsAuth(true);
  };

  const handleScrapeTrigger = async () => {
    setIsScraping(true);
    try {
      const response = await fetch("/api/scrape", { method: "POST" });
      const data = await response.json();
      if (data.success) {
        showToast(
          "success",
          "랭킹 데이터 수집 완료",
          `수집 시각: ${new Date(data.run.timestamp).toLocaleTimeString("ko-KR")} · 신규 알림 ${data.newTriggeredAlertsCount}건`
        );
        await Promise.all([fetchMetadata(), fetchAlerts(), fetchMonitoringLogs()]);
        setSelectedTimestamp(data.run.timestamp);
      } else {
        showToast("error", "수집 실패", data.error || "스크래핑 중 오류가 발생했습니다.");
      }
    } catch (err: any) {
      showToast("error", "네트워크 오류", err.message);
    } finally {
      setIsScraping(false);
    }
  };

  const handleAddAlert = async (alertObj: Omit<CustomAlert, "id" | "createdAt">) => {
    const newAlert: CustomAlert = {
      ...alertObj,
      id: `alert_${Date.now()}`,
      createdAt: new Date().toISOString()
    };
    const res = await fetch("/api/alerts", {
      method: "POST",
      headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
      body: JSON.stringify(newAlert)
    });
    if (res.ok) {
      fetchAlerts();
      showToast("success", "알림 규칙 등록 완료", `'${alertObj.name}' 조건이 활성화되었습니다.`);
    } else {
      throw new Error("알림 저장에 실패했습니다.");
    }
  };

  const handleDeleteAlert = async (id: string) => {
    const res = await fetch("/api/alerts/delete", {
      method: "POST",
      headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
      body: JSON.stringify({ id })
    });
    if (res.ok) fetchAlerts();
  };

  const handleMarkAsRead = async (id: string) => {
    const res = await fetch("/api/triggered-alerts/read", {
      method: "POST",
      headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
      body: JSON.stringify({ id })
    });
    if (res.ok) fetchAlerts();
  };

  const handleClearTriggered = async () => {
    const res = await fetch("/api/triggered-alerts/clear", { method: "POST" });
    if (res.ok) fetchAlerts();
  };

  const handleClearMonitoringLogs = async () => {
    const res = await fetch("/api/monitoring-logs/clear", { method: "POST" });
    if (res.ok) fetchMonitoringLogs();
  };

  const handleTriggerTestLogs = async () => {
    const res = await fetch("/api/monitoring-logs/trigger-test", { method: "POST" });
    if (res.ok) fetchMonitoringLogs();
  };

  const handleResolveMonitoringLog = async (id: string) => {
    const res = await fetch("/api/monitoring-logs/resolve", {
      method: "POST",
      headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
      body: JSON.stringify({ id, status: "resolved" })
    });
    if (res.ok) fetchMonitoringLogs();
  };

  const handleResolveAllMonitoringLogs = async () => {
    const res = await fetch("/api/monitoring-logs/resolve-all", { method: "POST" });
    if (res.ok) fetchMonitoringLogs();
  };

  const handleGenerateInsight = async (categoryId: string): Promise<MDInsight> => {
    const res = await fetch("/api/insights/generate", {
      method: "POST",
      headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
      body: JSON.stringify({ categoryId })
    });
    const data = await res.json();
    if (data.success) return data.insight;
    throw new Error(data.error || "Gemini 분석 생성에 실패했습니다.");
  };

  const handleExportSheets = async () => {
    if (!token) throw new Error("Google 계정 로그인이 필요합니다.");
    const records = [
      ...domesticProducts.map((p) => ({ ...p, timestamp: new Date(p.timestamp).toLocaleString("ko-KR") })),
      ...globalProducts.map((p) => ({ ...p, timestamp: new Date(p.timestamp).toLocaleString("ko-KR") }))
    ];
    const catName = categories.find((c) => c.id === selectedCategory)?.name || selectedCategory;
    const title = `올리브영_${catName}_랭킹분석_${new Date().toLocaleDateString("ko-KR")}`;

    const res = await fetch("/api/export-sheets", {
      method: "POST",
      headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
      body: JSON.stringify({ accessToken: token, title, records })
    });
    const data = await res.json();
    if (res.ok && data.success) {
      return { success: true, sheetUrl: data.sheetUrl, exportedCount: data.exportedCount };
    }
    throw new Error(data.error || "시트 내보내기에 실패했습니다.");
  };

  const latestRun = historyRuns[0];
  const totalProductsCount = domesticProducts.length + globalProducts.length;
  const unreadAlertsCount = triggeredAlerts.filter((a) => !a.isRead).length;
  const unresolvedSlaErrors = monitoringLogs.filter((l) => l.status !== "resolved" && l.level === "error").length;

  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen bg-[#F4F6F8] text-[#1A1C1E] font-sans antialiased pb-16" id="applet-dashboard">
      {/* 비차단형 토스트 알림 배너 */}
      <AnimatePresence>
        {toast && (
          <motion.div
            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: -20, scale: 0.95 }}
            animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0, scale: 1 }}
            exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20, scale: 0.95 }}
            className="fixed top-16 right-4 z-[60] max-w-sm w-full bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gray-200 p-4 flex items-start gap-3"
          >
            {toast.type === "success" ? (
              <CheckCircle2 className="w-5 h-5 text-[#98B941] shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            ) : (
              <AlertTriangle className="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            )}
            <div className="flex-1 min-w-0">
              <p className="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">{toast.title}</p>
              <p className="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">{toast.description}</p>
            </div>
            <button onClick={() => setToast(null)} className="text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 cursor-pointer">
              <X className="w-4 h-4" />
            </button>
          </motion.div>
        )}
      </AnimatePresence>

      {/* 1. Header Navigation Bar */}
      <header className="bg-white border-b border-gray-200 sticky top-0 z-40 shadow-xs" id="dashboard-navbar">
        <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div className="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#98B941] flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-xs">
              <Activity className="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                <h1 className="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">
                  올리브영 트렌드 인텔리전스
                </h1>
                <span className="text-xs bg-[#98B941]/15 text-[#7a9630] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-[#98B941]/30 hidden sm:inline-block">
                  v1.3 PRO
                </span>
              </div>
              <p className="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">국내몰 vs 글로벌몰 TOP 30 비교 및 AI MD 전략 대시보드</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* 우측 액션 컨트롤러 */}
          <div className="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            {/* 데이터 소스 투명성 배지 (실시간 vs 시뮬레이션) */}
            <div
              className={`hidden md:flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold border ${
                latestRun?.isSimulated === false
                  ? "bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800"
                  : "bg-amber-50 border-amber-200 text-amber-800"
              }`}
            >
              <span
                className={`w-2 h-2 rounded-full ${
                  latestRun?.isSimulated === false ? "bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse" : "bg-amber-500"
                }`}
              />
              <span>{latestRun?.isSimulated === false ? "실시간 데이터 연동" : "시뮬레이션 폴백 모드"}</span>
            </div>

            {/* 알림 드로어 오픈 버튼 */}
            <button
              onClick={() => {
                setHasNewAlert(false);
                setIsAlertDrawerOpen(true);
              }}
              className="relative bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 p-2 rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-pointer"
              title="맞춤 알림 설정 및 내역"
            >
              <Bell className={`w-4 h-4 ${hasNewAlert ? "text-red-500 animate-bounce" : ""}`} />
              {unreadAlertsCount > 0 && (
                <span className="absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-red-500 text-white text-[11px] font-bold w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                  {unreadAlertsCount}
                </span>
              )}
            </button>

            {/* 수동 스크래핑 실행 버튼 */}
            <button
              onClick={handleScrapeTrigger}
              disabled={isScraping}
              className="bg-[#98B941] hover:bg-[#85a337] active:scale-95 transition-all text-white text-xs font-bold py-2 px-3.5 rounded-lg shadow-xs cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1.5 disabled:bg-gray-300 disabled:scale-100"
            >
              <Play className={`w-3.5 h-3.5 ${isScraping ? "animate-spin" : ""}`} />
              <span>{isScraping ? "수집 중..." : "지금 랭킹 수집"}</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      {/* 2. Main Dashboard Stage */}
      <main className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 mt-5 space-y-5" id="dashboard-stage">
        {/* 상단 KPI 요약 바 (가독성 개선 및 허위 숫자 360 제거) */}
        <section className="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3.5" id="stats-banner-grid">
          <div className="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-4 shadow-xs flex items-center gap-3">
            <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#98B941]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#98B941]">
              <Flame className="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span className="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 block">추적 카테고리</span>
              <span className="text-base font-extrabold text-gray-900">{categories.length}개 부문</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div className="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-4 shadow-xs flex items-center gap-3">
            <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#98B941]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#98B941]">
              <TrendingUp className="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span className="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 block">현재 카테고리 분석 상품</span>
              {isDataLoading ? (
                <div className="h-5 w-16 bg-gray-200 animate-pulse rounded mt-1" />
              ) : (
                <span className="text-base font-extrabold text-gray-900">{totalProductsCount}개 (국내·글로벌)</span>
              )}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div className="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-4 shadow-xs flex items-center gap-3">
            <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600">
              <Clock className="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <div className="min-w-0">
              <span className="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 block">최근 업데이트</span>
              <span className="text-sm font-extrabold text-gray-900 truncate block">
                {latestRun
                  ? new Date(latestRun.timestamp).toLocaleTimeString("ko-KR", { hour: "2-digit", minute: "2-digit" })
                  : "수집 이력 없음"}
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button
            type="button"
            onClick={() => {
              setHasNewAlert(false);
              setIsAlertDrawerOpen(true);
            }}
            className={`rounded-xl border p-4 shadow-xs flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer transition-all text-left ${
              unreadAlertsCount > 0 ? "bg-red-50/70 border-red-200" : "bg-white border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-300"
            }`}
          >
            <div
              className={`w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center ${
                unreadAlertsCount > 0 ? "bg-red-500 text-white" : "bg-[#98B941]/10 text-[#98B941]"
              }`}
            >
              <Bell className="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span className="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 block">미확인 트렌드 알림</span>
